<title>SOUTH KOREA: Two Hyundai firms win $45 mln Pakistan order.</title>
<headline>Two Hyundai firms win $45 mln Pakistan order.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Hyundai Engineering Co said on Friday that it and Hyundai Corp have jointly won a $45 million order from Pakistan's state-owned Oil and Gas Development Corp (OGDC) to build a gas compression platform in Pakistan.</p>
<p>Two Hyundai Group affiliates were awarded the project on a turnkey basis, said a statement from Hyundai Engineering.</p>
<p>The statement said the project was scheduled to be completed by May 1999.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
